<body>
    <div class="wrapper"><div class="container">
        Your parents are too busy with their own troubles to worry about yours. You grow up like this, unguided,
        unheard, and misunderstood. You don't blame them. It's not like you could've made better choices in their
        position. You're lucky. It's all average. Middle class. Suburban. Potential like a hot knife you've
        swallowed to remember the pain. Did
        no one teach you to reach for the stars? Remember this when you make your choices.
    </div>
